{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/19531","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/19531/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/19531/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/19531/events","html_url":"https://github.com/symfony/symfony/issues/19531","id":169390852,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxNjkzOTA4NTI=","number":19531,"title":"[Form] DateType fails parsing when midnight is not a valid time","user":{"login":"Jean85","id":6729988,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjk5ODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6729988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jean85","html_url":"https://github.com/Jean85","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jean85/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jean85/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jean85/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jean85/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jean85/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jean85/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jean85/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jean85/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jean85/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":99594,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5OTU5NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/Form","name":"Form","color":"DDDDDD","default":false,"description":null},{"id":100079,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDAwNzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"e10c02","default":false,"description":null},{"id":237550465,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzc1NTA0NjU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/Status:%20Reviewed","name":"Status: Reviewed","color":"bfe5bf","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2016-08-04T14:39:49Z","updated_at":"2016-08-24T08:49:21Z","closed_at":"2016-08-13T18:47:49Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In some timezones, **midnight may not be a valid date**; this happens when the DST change was done on midnight. It's a poor choice, and it was done only in the past. If you enter those dates in a `DateType`, it gets rejected as invalid. \n\nUnder the hood, the issue is with the `\\IntlDateFormatter` that is initialized with the current timezone, when with a simple date it can be avoided... Here: https://github.com/symfony/symfony/blob/3.1/src/Symfony/Component/Form/Extension/Core/DataTransformer/DateTimeToLocalizedStringTransformer.php#L119\n\nMaybe decoupling between DateType and DateTimeType could be a solution?\n\nIn my case, TZ is `Europe/Rome` and one of the infamous date is `1978-05-28`; I can reproduce the issue in this 3val: https://3v4l.org/NDnbm\nDateTime doesn't suffer this bug: https://3v4l.org/ZmQ1q\n\nMainly, the Form uses the intl extension, that uses ICU, and that assumes midnight as the hour if not specified, which is what happens when  you use a `DateType` field.\n\nI tried to open a bug on https://bugs.php.net/bug.php?id=72649 but it got closed... What can we do about it?\n\nPS: this issue surfaced already multiple times: #18267 #16518 #16368\n","closed_by":{"login":"fabpot","id":47313,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MzEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47313?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot","html_url":"https://github.com/fabpot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/19531/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/19531/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}